//
// # Safety
//
// `op` is `NULL` or points to `op_len` readable bytes; `operand` is `NULL` or
// a live `cr_node`; `text` is `NULL` or points to `len` readable bytes; `out`
// is `NULL` or points to a writable `cr_node *`; `error` is `NULL` or points
